      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ashley%2C_North_Dakota"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Founded in 1888 after Hoskins fell, Ashley’s first settlers were mainly Scotch and English immigrants from Ohio and Michigan.",
